{
  "_": "The pack catalog behind the Looks and the Shop (vision M8). A look is one part per layer (looks/parts.py draws them; scripts/looks.py export writes the PNGs the dashboard composes) and one colour per slot. Packs are what the Shop sells: `free` packs join the wardrobe with one tap, a priced pack takes an unlock code (`unlock: \"code\"`) signed by the owner's key and checked by the gateway against `unlock.public_key` (scripts/unlock_codes.py mints them); `soon` packs are announced and empty. Add a pack by drawing its parts in parts.py, listing them here, running `python3 scripts/looks.py export`, and `check` keeps everything in step.",
